{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"opaque"},{"type":"text","text":" object CONTRACT.md §23 defines: a registration record and the server-issued"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session handle that identifies the exchange it came from."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OpaqueEnrollment"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The server cannot build this — it never sees the plaintext — so any request that ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"sets","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"password has to carry it: ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/auth\/password\/change","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/auth\/reset\/confirm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/admin\/bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note what is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" here. The SRP enrolment this replaces carried a salt, a group and a full set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of KDF costs, and required the account’s canonical username — passing an email produced a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verifier no login could ever satisfy, and renaming a user invalidated their verifier outright."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A record binds to a credential identifier the server chooses, and the key-stretching parameters"},{"type":"text","text":" "}